{"id":"P025-1","subject":"P","unit":"P025","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P025-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 옳은 것은?\n\n   수차 발전기의 출력은 유효낙차에 ( ㉠  )하고,\n\n   유량에 ( ③  )한다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n ①      비례          비례\n ②      비례         반비례\n ③     반비례          비례\n ④     반비례         반비례","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":668},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":499}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n1년 365일 중 275일은 이 수위보다 내려가지 않는 유량\n\n을 의미하는 것은?\n\n\n① 갈수량        ② 저수량\n\n③ 평수량        ④ 풍수량","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":804},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m02-e2.webp","width":696,"height":301}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n다음 관계식의 빈칸에 들어갈 것은?\n\n         1BTU×(     )kWh\n\n\n\n                            \n①            ②       \n\n                             \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":467}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n수압철관의 안지름이 4m인 곳에서의 유속이 2ms이\n\n었다. 안지름이 2m인 곳에서의 유속은 약 몇 ms인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 8           ② 16\n\n③ 24          ④ 32","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":671},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1117}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n화력발전소에서 증기 및 급수가 흐르는 순서는?\n\n\n① 절탄기- 보일러- 과열기- 터빈- 복수기\n\n② 보일러- 과열기- 절탄기- 터빈- 복수기\n\n③ 보일러- 절탄기- 과열기- 터빈- 복수기\n\n④ 절탄기- 과열기- 보일러- 터빈- 복수기","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n화력 발전소에서 매 시간당 발열량이 6000kcalkg인\n\n석탄 8.6ton을 사용하여 18000kW의 전력을 발생시\n\n킬 때, 이 발전기의 효율은?\n\n\n① 25          ② 30\n\n③ 35          ④ 40","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":562},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1145}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n원자력 발전소의 원자로는 화력 발전소의 무엇과 역할이\n\n같은가?\n\n\n① 보일러        ② 재열기\n\n③ 절탄기        ④ 과열기","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":737}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n다음 설명에 해당하는 물질은?\n\n 핵분열 연쇄반응이 잘 일어날 수 있도록 고속중성자의\n\n  에너지를 감소시켜 열중성자로 감속되도록 하는 물질로\n\n  경수, 중수, 베릴륨, 흑연 등이 있다.\n\n\n\n① 감속재        ② 제어재\n\n③ 냉각재        ④ 차폐재","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":678},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n정상상태에 있는 열출력 2000MW 원자로에 부(-) 반응\n\n도가 삽입되어 20초 후 열출력이 200MW로 떨어졌다면,\n\n1분 후의 원자로 열출력은 대략 몇 MW인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":642},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":788}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n1선당 대지 정전용량이 F이고, 주파수가 60Hz인                          \n3상 154kV 송전선로에 소호리액터 접지를 할 때, 소호\n\n리액터의 공진 리액턴스Ω는?\n\n\n                     \n①            ②     \n\n                     \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":657},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1094}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n수전단을 단락한 경우 송전단에서 본 임피던스는 300Ω이\n\n고, 수전단을 개방한 경우에는 1200Ω일 때, 이 선로의 특\n\n성 임피던스는 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n① 4000         ② 600\n\n③ 900         ④ 1200","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":583},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1207}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n다음의 각 설명에 해당하는 중성점 접지방식은?\n\n   ㉠ 병렬공진을 이용하여 지락전류를 소멸시킬수\n\n    있어 1선 지락시 지락전류가 거의 0이다.\n\n   ㉡ 1선 지락시 지락전류의 검출이 가능하고,\n\n    지락전류를 낮은 값으로 제한할 수 있으나,\n\n    장거리 선로에는 사용이 제한된다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①    직접접지방식       비접지방식\n\n ②  소호리액터접지방식     비접지방식\n\n ③    직접접지방식      고저항접지방식\n\n ④  소호리액터접지방식    고저항접지방식","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":675},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m12-e2.webp","width":696,"height":442}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n송전선로의 코로나 손실을 감소시키기 위한 대책방안으로 옳\n\n은 것은?\n\n      ㉠ 복도체 방식을 채용한다.\n\n      ㉡ 지름이 큰 전선을 사용한다.\n\n      ㉢ 코로나 임계전압을 낮게한다.\n\n      ㉣ 송전선로의 절연을 강화한다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠, ㉡        ② ㉠, ㉢\n\n③ ㉡, ㉢        ④ ㉡, ㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":718},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1442}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n154kV 송전선로에서 송전거리가 308km라 할 때,\n\n송전용량 계수법에 의한 송전용량은 몇 kW인가?\n\n(단, 송전용량 계수는 1000으로 한다.)\n\n\n① 77000        ② 122000\n\n③ 154000       ④ 308000","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1122}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n송전전압이 154kV인 2회선 선로가 있다. 선로 길이가\n\n200km이고 선로의 1선당 작용 정전용량이 0.01Fkm\n\n라고 한다. 이것을 자기 여자를 일으키지 않고 충전하기\n\n위해서는 최소한 몇 MVA이상의 발전기를 이용하여야\n\n하는가? (단, 주파수는 50Hz이다.)\n\n\n① × ×     ② × × \n③ × ×    ④ × × ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":602},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":760}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n연부하율은 연간전력량kWh, 연간최대전력kW과 어떤\n\n관계를 갖는가?\n\n\n① 연간전력량, 연간최대전력에 비례한다.\n\n② 연간전력량, 연간최대전력에 반비례한다.\n\n③ 연간전력량에는 비례, 연간최대전력에는 반비례한다.\n\n④ 연간전력량에는 반비례, 연간최대전력에는 비례한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":715},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n피뢰기의 제한전압이 800kV이고, 변압기의 기준 충격\n절연강도가 1200kV라고 하면, 보호 여유도는 몇 인\n\n가?\n\n\n① 45          ② 50\n\n③ 55          ④ 60","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":757}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음 내용의 빈 칸에 들어갈 내용으로 옳은 것은?\n\n  계통의 안정도를 향상시키기 위해서는 단락비를\n\n  크게해야 하며, 이 경우에 발전기 및 변압기의\n\n  리액턴스는 ( ㉠  ), 전압변동률은 ( ㉡  ).\n\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①      작고          작다\n\n ②      작고          크다\n\n ③      크고          작다\n\n ④      크고          크다","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":605},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m18-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1125}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n다음의 각 설명에 해당하는 리액터는?\n\n   ㉠ 페란티 현상을 억제하기 위해 사용된다.\n\n   ㉡ 지락전류를 제한하기 위해 사용된다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①    분로리액터       한류리액터\n\n ②    소호리액터       분로리액터\n\n ③    분로리액터       소호리액터\n\n ④    소호리액터       직렬리액터","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":670},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":634}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 들어갈 말로 옳은 것은?\n\n  전력계통의 전압을 조정하는 가장 보편적인 방법은\n\n    (      )을 조정하는 것으로, 이를 조정하기 위해\n\n  동기조상기나 전력용 콘덴서를 이용한다.\n\n\n\n① 계통의 무효전력    ② 계통의 유효전력\n\n③ 계통의 주파수     ④ 계통의 전압위상","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":598},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":428}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n다음 중 변전소의 기능으로 옳은 것은?\n\n     ㉠ 전류의 변성 및 조정\n\n     ㉡ 전력의 발생과 분배\n\n     ㉢ 유효전력과 무효전력의 제어\n\n     ㉣ 계통 및 기기의 보호\n\n\n\n① ㉠, ㉡        ② ㉠, ㉢\n\n③ ㉡, ㉣        ④ ㉢, ㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":615},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":821}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n지지물간의 간격이 m, 수평장력이 kg일 때의 이도\n\n가 m인 가공 전선로가 있다. 지지물간의 간격이 m,\n\n수평장력이 kg인 경우의 이도는 의 몇 배인가?\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":665},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n설비용량이 1200kW, 부등률이 1.2, 수용률이 60일 때,\n변전시설의 용량은 최저 몇 kVA이상이어야 하는가?\n\n(단, 역률은 80로 유지된다.)\n\n\n① 650         ② 750\n\n③ 850         ④ 950","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m23-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n8극, 900rpm의 동기 발전기와 병렬운전하는 6극 동기\n\n발전기의 회전수는 몇 rpm인가?\n\n\n① 900         ② 1000\n\n③ 1200         ④ 1400","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":615},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P025-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n다음 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 선로의 전압을 배 승압하면 선로의 전력손실율은\n\n 승압전의 ( ㉠ )배가 되고, 선로의 전력손실률이 일정\n\n 한 경우에 공급전력은 승압전의 ( ㉡ )배가 된다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n                \n ①                                        \n\n                \n ②                                            \n\n                                       \n ③                                                           \n\n                                       \n ④                                                              ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.02.24 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e05-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":814},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e05-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1226}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
